many_daugh~s |   .0387536   .0136536     2.84   0.005     .0119919    .0655152
     sumkids |   -.055418   .0050324   -11.01   0.000    -.0652818   -.0455542
       _cons |    3.11827   .0091474   340.89   0.000     3.100341      3.1362
